Package: tobit.mean
Title: Calculate Descriptive Statistics of Censored Vectors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Bill", "Denney", , "wdenney@humanpredictions.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5759-428X"))
Description: Calculate descriptive statistics of left- and right-censored
    numeric vectors: the arithmetic mean, geometric mean, standard deviation,
    and percent coefficient of variation.  Censoring is accounted for by
    maximum likelihood estimation with the Tobit model (Tobin (1958)
    <doi:10.2307/1907382>), using the convex reparameterization of the
    likelihood described by Olsen (1978) <doi:10.2307/1911445>, rather than
    by ignoring or substituting censored values.
